# Fresh isolated --library only. Root schedules PID-validated OS AX actions
# while this finite presented-frame window is alive. No scripted edit actions.
log Actual OS AX probe session: mode press and numeric hue value
settle 4
remember original
capture ax_initial
settle 1500
assert snap mode == dark
differs original primary
same original name theme graph_selected
capture ax_mutated
